{
    "about": "How every shell answers an address of its own host from the Installed Build (apps/client/installed-build.ts). The reference server (apps/client/scripts/serve-installed.mjs), the desktop app (apps/desktop/src/web/installed-build.ts) and the Android app (web/InstalledBuild.kt) each serve `files` and check every request against these answers. `path` is the address's path as it was sent, still escaped. Every answer carries a policy: a worker takes the policy of its own script, so a script is answered with one too.",
